     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/6/csm_Infolayer_toolCart_lochraster_4391f1bb0e.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Sturdy mold change frame",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Sturdy mold change frame</h3> <p>Tool change frames - can be universally attached to the grid of the side walls and are suitable for complete tools of various sizes. Thanks to the sturdy design, you can transport a total load of up to 250 kg with the »toolCart 750« despite its low tare weight. Thanks to mounting hook sets, important accessories such as oil cans or gloves can be stored securely on the flexible mounting grid.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/5/csm_Infolayer_toolCart_rahmen_88fd5333c1.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Flexible inserts",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Flexible inserts</h3> <p>Inserts - enable the organized storage of complete tools of different sizes. The Y-shape of the tool inserts allows you to transport even more tools per frame in the »toolCart 750« to save space, e.g. HSK 63.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/c/csm_Infolayer_toolCart_griff_f662d3dac9.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 616,
     "h": 334,
     "title": "Ergonomic handle",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Ergonomic handle</h3> <p>handle - in an extremely stable and functional manner reliably equips the »toolCart«. Tools and adapters can be transported safely and conveniently through production.</p> </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
